{"id":"n91682-1-7","stage":4,"title":"지그시 · 轻轻地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91682-1-7-1","ko":"음악이 참 좋네요.","zh":"音乐真好听啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음악이","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악이","audio":"/audio/73fb5ea6da0471d25f2b.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"좋네요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋네요","audio":"/audio/e36ecc80346ba52c878b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"88caa317d96897c9","term":"음악","zh":"音乐","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3","entryId":"71115","definition":"用嗓音或乐器按照拍子和节奏发出声音，表达想法或感情的艺术。","pronunciation":["으막"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/b6f808c8648f0289b728.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91682-1-7-2","ko":"눈을 지그시 감고 들으면 더 좋아요.","zh":"轻轻闭上眼睛听的话，会更好听哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈을","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":